;. /capture_sources_flow
  ;@ /flow/definition capture_sources
  ;= Capture selected HTTP sources
    Accept named URL records with explicit revisions. Fetch through the shared HTTP hand and require successful retained responses. Failures use its ordinary holes and retries; no stale response becomes current evidence. SQL adapters and other JSON endpoints use the same procedure.
    Publish this procedure independently. Invoke it alone using the retain_result
    writer to inspect its work cells, or select it in another authored flow.

    ;@ /flow/input urls
    ;= urls

    ;@ /flow/step fetched ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/web_fetch
    ;@ /flow/bind urls urls
    ;= fetched

    ;@ /flow/step sources ;/0x11/gov/flows/operations/web_sources
    ;@ /flow/bind responses fetched
    ;= sources

    ;@ /flow/result sources
    ;= Retained result
